{"questions":[{"answer":2,"expl":"ABE'nin tabanı AB, yüksekliği E'den AB'ye uzaklık = dikdörtgenin yüksekliği (E, CD üzerinde nerede olursa olsun). Alan = AB · h/2 = dikdörtgenin yarısı. Eşit.","fig":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 150\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:260px\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"20.0,130.0 240.0,130.0 240.0,30.0 20.0,30.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-ink);fill:none;stroke-width:1.6\"/><polygon points=\"20.0,130.0 240.0,130.0 150.0,30.0\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-soft);stroke:var(--fig-ink);stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >A</text><text x=\"248.0\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >B</text><text x=\"248.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >C</text><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >D</text><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"22.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >E</text></svg><p class=\"nts\">Figure not drawn to scale.</p>","given":"<i>ABCD</i> is a rectangle, and point <i>E</i> lies on side <i>CD</i>.","id":"s1-1","qa":"The area of triangle <i>ABE</i>","qb":"Half the area of rectangle <i>ABCD</i>","short":"E'nin yerinin önemi yok; taban ve yükseklik sabit.","sub":"Aynı taban–aynı yükseklik","topic":"geo","type":"qc"},{"answer":0,"expl":"17/99 = 0,171717… &gt; 0,17.","id":"s1-2","qa":"<span class='frac'><span>17</span><span>99</span></span>","qb":"0.17","short":"Paydası 99 olan kesir iki basamaklı devir verir.","sub":"Devirli ondalık","topic":"arith","type":"qc"},{"answer":0,"expl":"64 &gt; 36.","id":"s1-3","qa":"2<sup>6</sup>","qb":"6<sup>2</sup>","short":"","sub":"Üsler","topic":"arith","type":"qc"},{"answer":3,"expl":"p = 3, q = 2: 9 &gt; 2 ve p &gt; q. p = 2, q = 3: 4 &gt; 3 ve p &lt; q → D.","given":"<i>p</i> and <i>q</i> are positive, and <i>p</i><sup>2</sup> &gt; <i>q</i>.","id":"s1-4","qa":"<i>p</i>","qb":"<i>q</i>","short":"p² &gt; q ilişkisi p ile q'yu sıralamaz; iki örnek yeter.","sub":"Eşitsizlik (örnek deneme)","topic":"alg","type":"qc"},{"answer":3,"choices":["$24,000","$26,880","$28,800","$30,000","$32,000"],"expl":"V · 0,8² = 19.200 → V = 19.200/0,64 = 30.000.","id":"s1-5","short":"%40 geri eklemek (19.200 · 1,4 = 26.880) yanlış; çarpanla böl.","stem":"The value of a car decreases by 20 percent each year. At the end of 2 years, the car is worth $19,200. What was the car worth at the beginning of the 2 years?","sub":"Ardışık azalış (geri hesap)","topic":"arith","type":"mc"},{"answer":3,"choices":["−4","−<span class='frac'><span>3</span><span>2</span></span>","<span class='frac'><span>3</span><span>2</span></span>","4","8"],"expl":"ax² + bx + c = 0 için kökler toplamı −b/a = 8/2 = 4.","id":"s1-6","short":"3/2 kökler çarpımıdır (c/a).","stem":"What is the sum of the solutions of the equation 2<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> − 8<i>x</i> + 3 = 0?","sub":"Kökler toplamı","topic":"alg","type":"mc"},{"answer":1,"choices":["20","21","22","40","42"],"expl":"2, 4, …, 40. 10. ve 11. terimler 20 ve 22 → medyan 21.","id":"s1-7","short":"Eşit aralıklı: (ilk + son)/2 = (2 + 40)/2 = 21.","stem":"What is the median of the first 20 positive even integers?","sub":"Medyan (çift sayıda eleman)","topic":"data","type":"mc"},{"answer":[0,2,4],"choices":["60°","100°","108°","130°","150°"],"expl":"Dış açı 180 − iç açı, ve 360'ı tam bölmeli. 60 → 120 (3 kenar) ✓; 100 → 80 (4,5) ✗; 108 → 72 (5) ✓; 130 → 50 (7,2) ✗; 150 → 30 (12) ✓.","fig":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 180\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:200px\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"100.0,25.0 166.6,73.4 141.1,151.6 58.9,151.6 33.4,73.4\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-soft);stroke:var(--fig-ink);stroke-width:1.6\"/></svg>","id":"s1-8","short":"Dış açılar üzerinden kontrol et.","stem":"Which of the following could be the measure of each interior angle of a regular polygon?<br><span class='hint'>Indicate <u>all</u> such measures.</span>","sub":"Düzgün çokgen iç açısı","topic":"geo","type":"ma"},{"answer":1,"choices":["4%","25%","40%","144%","400%"],"expl":"0,6/2,4 = 0,25 → %25.","id":"s1-9","short":"400% ters oran.","stem":"0.6 is what percent of 2.4?","sub":"Yüzde (oran)","topic":"arith","type":"mc"},{"answer":{"kind":"dec","value":-4},"expl":"Kökler çarpımı −12 → diğer kök −12/3 = −4. (k = 1.)","id":"s1-10","short":"k'yi bulmadan: çarpım = c/a.","stem":"If <i>x</i> = 3 is a solution of the equation <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + <i>kx</i> − 12 = 0, where <i>k</i> is a constant, what is the other solution?","sub":"Kök verildiğinde diğer kök","topic":"alg","type":"ne"},{"answer":1,"choices":["65%","68⅓%","70%","71%","75%"],"expl":"Geçen: 140 + 120 + 150 = 410. 410/600 = %68⅓.","id":"s1-11","set":"s1-di","short":"%70, yüzdelerin düz ortalaması; C okulu en kalabalık ve oranı en düşük.","stem":"For the three schools combined, what percent of the students tested passed the exam?","sub":"Ağırlıklı yüzde","topic":"data","type":"mc"},{"answer":{"kind":"dec","value":50},"expl":"B'nin oranı %80. C'de %80 = 200 öğrenci; şu an 150 → 50 daha.","id":"s1-12","set":"s1-di","short":"Taban C'nin öğrenci sayısı (250).","stem":"How many more students at School C would have needed to pass for School C's pass rate to equal School B's pass rate?","sub":"Hedef oran","topic":"data","type":"ne"}],"sets":{"s1-di":{"html":"<div class=\"tbl\"><p class=\"cap\">EXAM RESULTS AT THREE SCHOOLS</p><table><thead><tr><th>School</th><th>Number of students tested</th><th>Percent who passed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>200</td><td>70%</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>150</td><td>80%</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>250</td><td>60%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","intro":"Questions 11 and 12 are based on the following data."}}}